// lesson, a 75-min core in exactly 4 stations (design v4 „task-based” on the v3 station engine,
// docs/COURSE_DESIGN_STATIONS.md §7); the module control is one sheet (≤ 10 blocks, 45 min). A2+/B1- stage: text
